Architecture: any
Description: HomeKit support for the impatient
 Homebridge lets devices that do not support Apple HomeKit show up in the
 Home app. This package holds Homebridge, the Homebridge UI and their own
 Node.js runtime. It runs them as a systemd service under its own user.
Homepage: https://homebridge.io
